  "description": "Balance bikes, like the Kink Coast, help teach children balance and coordination instead of relying on training wheels. What’s special about the Coast is the way it combines features and geometry for children, with that of a full size BMX bike. The Coast is a balance bike designed for working a child’s way up to their first BMX bike. This bike features an ultra-low standover height allowing the seat to be lowered as much as possible and comes in a cool Forge Blue colorway.\n\nNote: Designed for children ages 2 and up. Seat height adjustable from 14.25″-16.75″.",
